      ],
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "hook-01",
          "text": "月球南极，太阳贴着地平线，石头拖着长黑影。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/hook-01.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "9fe9785475434d3370a435ee1da478206b2a861edf89f22442433af97cacec47",
          "audio_duration_s": 4.536,
          "start_s": 0.65,
          "end_s": 5.186,
          "group": "hook"
        },
        {
          "id": "hook-02",
          "text": "机器人只拍到朝着自己的一面。背面有什么？",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/hook-02.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "8ae9c5eaeba3ba717a609a07476c509c4a82f8420a084c40128807ce1cec15bb",
          "audio_duration_s": 3.96,
          "start_s": 6.686,
          "end_s": 10.646,
          "group": "hook"
        }
      ],
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 13.0,
      "duration_s": 13.0
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison",
      "chapter": "三种做法",
      "base_duration_s": 28,
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "comparison",
          "type": "shared_clock",
          "base_duration_s": 28
        }
      ],
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "comparison-01",
          "text": "同一条路，同一机位，三种做法从同一时刻出发。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-01.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "09fe55f0841f76efec8d0bb78cb94e338be966ab6812609b18f53fbc0ca96e14",
          "audio_duration_s": 4.428,
          "start_s": 13.65,
          "end_s": 18.078,
          "group": "comparison"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparison-02",
          "text": "乐观车把没看见的当作没有，八十点八七秒，碰撞。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-02.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "97962ba7d398c89f123b112aeb687e301a3bf59dd5802738e696998fc123a63b",
          "audio_duration_s": 4.824,
          "start_s": 19.4732,
          "end_s": 24.297199999999997,
          "group": "comparison"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparison-03",
          "text": "Lux3D 想出背面，先检验再走：一眼，一百十二点八四秒，到达。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-03.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "8298a0570b9929fd6c6ba1aca01411dceee4239cadf1c3ecbe7044af03d6e579",
          "audio_duration_s": 7.344,
          "start_s": 25.6924,
          "end_s": 33.0364,
          "group": "comparison"
        },
        {
          "id": "comparison-04",
          "text": "保守车看了五眼，一百四十二点二零秒后，仍然没有路。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-04.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "0ccadd7e8729d79bcf96513dda945bf6fcdcbfe0dacf6c9321cc71b30c382418",
          "audio_duration_s": 4.428,
          "start_s": 34.4316,
          "end_s": 38.8596,
          "group": "comparison"
        }
      ],
      "start_s": 13.0,
      "end_s": 41.0,
      "duration_s": 28.0
    },
