      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "model-01",
          "text": "把照片交给 Lux3D，回来一整块石头，连看不见的背面也被补出来。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/model-01.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "0dbcb50cbf10cf881b9b08e84729c8390e73a619c8f35af476dfec0197178fee",
          "audio_duration_s": 5.364,
          "start_s": 41.65,
          "end_s": 47.013999999999996,
          "group": "model"
        },
        {
          "id": "model-02",
          "text": "但看起来像，不等于真实。通过正面核对的六十四份想象里，二十三份背面短了五厘米以上。",
          "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/model-02.mp3",
          "audio_sha256": "ddd9a6ff5ce469561d2e35c77fb6597735e80d41804e04f0b26612f2b9945a24",
          "audio_duration_s": 7.812,
          "start_s": 48.514,
          "end_s": 56.326,
          "group": "model"
        }
      ],
      "start_s": 41.0,
      "end_s": 59.0,
      "duration_s": 18.0
