  "captions": [
    {
      "id": "hook-01",
      "text": "月球南极，太阳贴着地平线，石头拖着长黑影。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/hook-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9fe9785475434d3370a435ee1da478206b2a861edf89f22442433af97cacec47",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.536,
      "start_s": 0.65,
      "end_s": 5.186,
      "group": "hook"
    },
    {
      "id": "hook-02",
      "text": "机器人只拍到朝着自己的一面。背面有什么？",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/hook-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8ae9c5eaeba3ba717a609a07476c509c4a82f8420a084c40128807ce1cec15bb",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.96,
      "start_s": 6.686,
      "end_s": 10.646,
      "group": "hook"
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison-01",
      "text": "同一条路，同一机位，三种做法从同一时刻出发。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "09fe55f0841f76efec8d0bb78cb94e338be966ab6812609b18f53fbc0ca96e14",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.428,
      "start_s": 13.65,
      "end_s": 18.078,
      "group": "comparison"
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison-02",
      "text": "乐观车把没看见的当作没有，八十点八七秒，碰撞。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "97962ba7d398c89f123b112aeb687e301a3bf59dd5802738e696998fc123a63b",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.824,
      "start_s": 19.4732,
      "end_s": 24.297199999999997,
      "group": "comparison"
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison-03",
      "text": "Lux3D 想出背面，先检验再走：一眼，一百十二点八四秒，到达。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8298a0570b9929fd6c6ba1aca01411dceee4239cadf1c3ecbe7044af03d6e579",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.344,
      "start_s": 25.6924,
      "end_s": 33.0364,
      "group": "comparison"
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison-04",
      "text": "保守车看了五眼，一百四十二点二零秒后，仍然没有路。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/comparison-04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0ccadd7e8729d79bcf96513dda945bf6fcdcbfe0dacf6c9321cc71b30c382418",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.428,
      "start_s": 34.4316,
      "end_s": 38.8596,
      "group": "comparison"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-01",
      "text": "把照片交给 Lux3D，回来一整块石头，连看不见的背面也被补出来。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/model-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0dbcb50cbf10cf881b9b08e84729c8390e73a619c8f35af476dfec0197178fee",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.364,
      "start_s": 41.65,
      "end_s": 47.013999999999996,
      "group": "model"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-02",
      "text": "但看起来像，不等于真实。通过正面核对的六十四份想象里，二十三份背面短了五厘米以上。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/model-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ddd9a6ff5ce469561d2e35c77fb6597735e80d41804e04f0b26612f2b9945a24",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.812,
      "start_s": 48.514,
      "end_s": 56.326,
      "group": "model"
    },
    {
      "id": "reveal-01",
      "text": "正面通过了核对，这一份背面却短了零点七米。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/reveal-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2945240ab3ddf8e542aed6b0a323c335ccc3ca47a06098182e27750ac85d902e",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.248,
      "start_s": 59.65,
      "end_s": 63.897999999999996,
      "group": "reveal"
    },
    {
      "id": "worlds-01",
      "text": "所以我们生成多份、核对正面，再在每一份想象里预演完整路线，全部安全才迈步。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/worlds-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "612222a02c30c2ff19a4990917e2207bb34f643a80721a356c3e8b2a16cb93d6",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.128,
      "start_s": 68.65,
      "end_s": 75.778,
      "group": "worlds"
    },
    {
      "id": "worlds-02",
      "text": "十二个世界，都先走完。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/worlds-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "da718e71bb7471713fbe5457d47fd0b06bb2de700bf86efc33cf25a42f99d972",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.196,
      "start_s": 76.67,
      "end_s": 78.866,
      "group": "worlds"
    },
    {
      "id": "results-01",
      "text": "八个决定性场景，预先按真实形状走通、乐观撞、保守停来选定。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/results-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c22d922c0eb248ef2663371fa0e5e21566c073af1d5423fc7ebff127aee7cf5f",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.12,
      "start_s": 80.65,
      "end_s": 86.77000000000001,
      "group": "results"
    },
    {
      "id": "results-02",
      "text": "在这八个别的做法都到不了的场景里，想象让机器人到了三个。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/results-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b07859545c5355b58c28392f2a1aafe7d7648b63040ca6929b944bf3c3d0059e",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.04,
      "start_s": 88.2076,
      "end_s": 93.2476,
      "group": "results"
    },
    {
      "id": "results-03",
      "text": "它也撞了二次，二次都留在页面上。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/results-03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e275d0d9ef5f09148a81c22b90e59de7848e549d1cb2d28b54ede66f8d6677a0",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.952,
      "start_s": 94.6852,
      "end_s": 97.63719999999999,
      "group": "results"
    },
    {
      "id": "results-04",
      "text": "这次就是原事故，画面连续保留。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/results-04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a574ec23c47784f042b28edf14ee2f5ecb817b34c2ac13a7ef0b8bed2c430d75",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.7,
      "start_s": 99.0748,
      "end_s": 101.7748,
      "group": "results"
    },
    {
      "id": "post-01",
      "text": "赛后收紧规则，十七场没有碰撞，但十四场停车。更安全，也更常停。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/post-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2691e33a2eaacd0ba6b1fdd9fcd163d2978b3b96198edcdcb639533119840ba7",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.552,
      "start_s": 104.65,
      "end_s": 111.202,
      "group": "post"
    },
    {
      "id": "wheel-01",
      "text": "路上还有矮门槛，轮子却过不去。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/wheel-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d69fe457b769d0624409b6d602c9f0055bfa0e97dac6aa773675364a9ccc2ccf",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.844,
      "start_s": 113.578,
      "end_s": 116.422,
      "group": "wheel"
    },
    {
      "id": "leg-01",
      "text": "同一高度带，轮行九十次，没有一次通过；逐轮抬腿，二十四次全部干净跨过。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/leg-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a0abfc8ade61ca86db470a5d2c82e704b7bbbf7037c2831b37004377b4f16dca",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.38,
      "start_s": 117.65,
      "end_s": 125.03,
      "group": "leg"
    },
    {
      "id": "leg-02",
      "text": "动作只用看见的几何，不靠想象。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/leg-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "74fefa3813224aa9b25178b74617338a6f229e289c61e518c106eccecdc5a618",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.024,
      "start_s": 126.53,
      "end_s": 129.554,
      "group": "leg"
    },
    {
      "id": "connect-01",
      "text": "两种石头连成一条路，先绕过高石，再穿门跨过门槛。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/connect-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1743c53516ec1ab92c4fba47617f1383e42840b67501f0ca14f61d1526cbde82",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.968,
      "start_s": 133.65,
      "end_s": 138.618,
      "group": "connect"
    },
    {
      "id": "connect-02",
      "text": "这里用真实形状做连接预检查，转场处交接保存状态。不是正式车的到达成绩。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/connect-02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bd1e26d20063419bef92cc33d79f4bac761845a356c2476a79ef5bdec6bc8e38",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.128,
      "start_s": 140.118,
      "end_s": 147.24599999999998,
      "group": "connect"
    },
    {
      "id": "close-01",
      "text": "门槛近景再看一次：抬轮、越过、落地。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/close-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "513df5489314439a3ff0c8ebdb937fbcefb34e0b002900c8b57c351a326404f2",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.14,
      "start_s": 151.65,
      "end_s": 155.79,
      "group": "close"
    },
    {
      "id": "stopA-01",
      "text": "换回想象，后石候选全被拒绝，车停了。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/stopA-01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5bb321a5e71eb1de7bc8031dd11752f6abd67bf8728e4f116f766954434194e6",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.996,
      "start_s": 161.804,
      "end_s": 165.8,
      "group": "stopA"
    },
    {
      "id": "stopB-01",
      "text": "只信看见的车，也在高石前停下。",
      "audio": "evidence/production-v6/film/audio/stopB-01.mp3",
